hich fits within 144. Item 0 lasts 4 days, so it covers a 3-day cycle.\n- **Every 2 days:** the least stock, but 222 more in order fees than a 3-day cycle. On balance the 2-day and 3-day cycles come out close.\n\n**3. Order size**\n- Running short costs more than leftover stock: 9 per unit for item 0 (3 margin + 6 penalty) and 8 for item 1 (4 + 4). A leftover unit loses at most its purchase price plus holding. Demand also averages about 4.6% above forecast. So ordering above forecast pays off.\n- Among the 3-day plans: 1 (about 1.1× forecast) > 6 (about 1.0×) > 3 (about 0.9×).\n- Among the 2-day plans: 4 (about 1.25×) > 7 (about 1.1×) > 0 (below forecast).\n- None of the plans runs out of cash.\n\nThat puts 1, 6, 4 and 7 in the top half. Candidates 0, 3, 2 and 5 are likely in the bottom half."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5052, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5052}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:48:20.566Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWADC3c9gd3ures5Lwsn"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015euomemkw5mfcH8SFRrHUW", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWADCHVbQ6Jbzje3CAmv", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015euomemkw5mfcH8SFRrHUW", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.3, 0.7